        <activityName xml:lang="en">Industrial furnace, coal, 1-10 MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Industrial furnace, coal, 1-10 MW
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. No assessment was performed on different types of furnaces.;
UUID: 6c551dda-0d75-3965-9931-1ad15f594987
Average stoker furnace operational in the early 1990s. The module includes materials, energy and transport requirements used for construction of the plant. Disposal of material is also included.
Location: German condition.
Technology: Average used in early 1990s. Stoker boiler used as reference technology.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6c551dda-0d75-3965-9931-1ad15f594987.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
